1
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:07,160
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:11,840
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:16,160
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:20,440
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,360
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,800
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,800
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:30,680
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,360
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,840
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:40,640
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,600
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:46,680
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:48,680
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:49,680
=Episode 1=

17
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:54,679
(Chancellor Lu Dingyuan
conspired with Xiqing.)

18
00:00:54,679 --> 00:00:56,000
(He undermined the court.)

19
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,840
(For his act of high treason,)

20
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:59,399
(his entire clan shall be executed.)

21
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:02,359
(Lu Yunluo, Chancellor Lu's Daughter)
My father was always loyal.

22
00:01:03,399 --> 00:01:04,920
He gave everything to this country.

23
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:09,879
How could he have betrayed it?

24
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,799
(Cold Palace)

25
00:01:12,799 --> 00:01:15,280
(His daughter, Lu Yunluo,)

26
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:17,560
(has been crowned Empress.)

27
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:20,680
(She is therefore spared execution)

28
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:22,159
(and banished to the Cold Palace,)

29
00:01:22,159 --> 00:01:24,079
(never to leave again.)

30
00:01:27,560 --> 00:01:28,560
(Empress?)

31
00:01:29,319 --> 00:01:31,439
(Even a sparrow has it better.)

32
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:33,319
(Burn.)

33
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:35,480
(Burn down the Cold
Palace and the imperial city.)

34
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:37,959
(Burn this rotten world to the ground!)

35
00:01:39,799 --> 00:01:42,239
(This awful plot is
making my blood boil.)

36
00:01:42,439 --> 00:01:43,680
(Overtime is bad enough.)

37
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,879
(Now even this show is making me mad.)

38
00:01:45,799 --> 00:01:47,760
(When can I afford to retire?)

39
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,799
(Where am I?)

40
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,319
(How did I get here?)

41
00:02:05,760 --> 00:02:07,560
(When the lab exploded,)

42
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:09,120
(I got sucked into my iPad.)

43
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,599
(Wait...)

44
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:12,560
(Am I inside that drama?)

45
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:12,800
(Welcome to your private realm.)

46
00:02:13,639 --> 00:02:14,360
(Correct.)

47
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,560
(You've been transported
to another world.)

48
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,400
(Who's talking?)

49
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:16,919
(Farming System)

50
00:02:16,919 --> 00:02:19,039
(I'm the smart assistant
for your farming system.)

51
00:02:19,319 --> 00:02:21,639
(I can help you grow crops.)

52
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:24,280
(Crops grow ten times faster)
(Every seed on Earth is available.)

53
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:26,400
(Plants grow faster
in the private realm.)

54
00:02:26,639 --> 00:02:28,639
(Upgrades will unlock more items.)

55
00:02:28,639 --> 00:02:31,199
(Anything produced here can be traded
across dimensions.)

56
00:02:31,639 --> 00:02:33,520
(Interdimensional trade?)

57
00:02:33,599 --> 00:02:34,960
(Then I'll be set for life!)

58
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:35,680
(My lady!)

59
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,680
(My lady, wake up!)

60
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:37,400
(My lady!)

61
00:02:39,919 --> 00:02:41,240
My lady, you're awake at last!

62
00:02:42,199 --> 00:02:43,000
My lady!

63
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:43,840
My lady, are you okay?

64
00:02:44,400 --> 00:02:45,840
She risked her life to protect me.

65
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,280
What a loyal maid.

66
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,280
(Yinshuang, Maid)
My lady!

67
00:02:49,639 --> 00:02:50,840
I won't leave you, my lady.

68
00:02:51,439 --> 00:02:52,199
Don't be afraid.

69
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:56,520
I'll get you out of here.

70
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,120
(I love this special power.)

71
00:03:00,439 --> 00:03:04,199
(I'm done being a wage slave.
I'm taking charge now!)

72
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:12,639
Are you all right?

73
00:03:13,759 --> 00:03:14,439
My lady.

74
00:03:14,439 --> 00:03:16,439
What kind of magic was that?

75
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:18,960
A gift from the system.

76
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,080
A three-minute free trial.

77
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,719
I'm afraid I don't understand.

78
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,479
Enough with the servant talk.

79
00:03:30,759 --> 00:03:32,560
We've faced death together.

80
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:34,919
We're sisters from now on.

81
00:03:37,159 --> 00:03:38,000
My lady.

82
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:39,759
I'm glad you've come around.

83
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:42,159
You're the Lu family's last hope.

84
00:03:42,319 --> 00:03:43,800
You must stay alive.

85
00:03:45,919 --> 00:03:49,960
Heaven gave me a second chance.

86
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,719
I'm not dying again.

87
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,159
I'm going to

88
00:03:53,599 --> 00:03:55,280
grow crops, make money,

89
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,400
and live my best life!

90
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:02,000
(Lixia Palace)

91
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:05,360
(The Emperor looks like a walnut
that got caught in a door.)

92
00:04:06,879 --> 00:04:08,639
Darling, I've missed you so much!

93
00:04:11,919 --> 00:04:13,680
(If I paint this royal bedroom scene)

94
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,159
(and sell the pictures,)

95
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:17,279
(I'll make ten silver pieces a copy.)

96
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:48,800
(Lixia Palace)

97
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:58,800
(Now that's a handsome guy.)

98
00:04:58,920 --> 00:04:59,879
Have you stared enough?

99
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:05,199
You nearly got me killed!

100
00:05:06,079 --> 00:05:06,879
I'm the one who...

101
00:05:06,879 --> 00:05:07,519
Shh!

102
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,720
It's the Emperor's wedding night.

103
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,519
If we're caught,

104
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:16,720
we're both done for.

105
00:05:18,279 --> 00:05:19,240
The Emperor?

106
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,279
You're here for a peek too?

107
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,199
Who exactly are you?

108
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:28,439
Oh, come on.

109
00:05:28,839 --> 00:05:30,399
We're in the same line of work.

110
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:34,240
Oh?

111
00:05:34,519 --> 00:05:35,879
And what line of work is that?

112
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,600
Me?

113
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:41,759
I'm the Emperor's painter.

114
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:43,360
(Royal Bedroom Secrets)

115
00:05:43,439 --> 00:05:46,519
This is a one-of-a-kind royal edition.

116
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:49,639
It shows just how babies are made.

117
00:05:49,639 --> 00:05:50,279
Future generations

118
00:05:50,279 --> 00:05:53,480
will treasure it and learn from it.

119
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:54,840
(Royal Bedroom Secrets)

120
00:05:59,120 --> 00:05:59,759
Well?

121
00:05:59,759 --> 00:06:00,639
Pretty good, right?

122
00:06:02,879 --> 00:06:03,920
Isn't that a walnut?

123
00:06:04,399 --> 00:06:04,879
Hey!

124
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:07,279
I even gave that ugly emperor
a beauty filter!

125
00:06:07,279 --> 00:06:07,759
You...

126
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:15,639
Never mind what you've drawn.

127
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:18,759
Do you know peeping at His Majesty
is punishable by death?

128
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,759
Who are you trying to scare?

129
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:23,600
Just say you want it.

130
00:06:23,639 --> 00:06:25,040
Since you're so handsome,

131
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,519
I'll give you a special price.

132
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:31,519
I never carry silver with me.

133
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,000
No money?

134
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,720
That's a problem.

135
00:06:39,399 --> 00:06:42,319
How about that jade pendant, then?

136
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:46,879
This is worth a fortune.

137
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,480
Are you sure you can take
something this valuable?

138
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:51,040
If you dare give it
to me, I dare take it.

139
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,920
(A token to remember me by.)

140
00:06:53,399 --> 00:06:54,600
(You won't get away now.)

141
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:56,759
Now that's quality.

142
00:06:56,759 --> 00:06:58,120
I've hit the jackpot.

143
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,800
What a sucker.

144
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:03,199
What are you muttering?

145
00:07:03,319 --> 00:07:06,519
I said you're kind and generous.

146
00:07:07,439 --> 00:07:09,439
Since you're such a good sport,

147
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:10,519
I'll treat you to some lotus wine.

148
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:15,879
A young lady inviting a man for drinks?

149
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,680
Try it.

150
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,480
Oh, you really meant lotus wine.

151
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,839
Excellent wine.

152
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:40,879
Of course.

153
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:42,600
I made it myself.

154
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,319
I was hoping

155
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,439
to sip it under the moon tonight

156
00:07:46,439 --> 00:07:47,279
and paint a little.

157
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:49,439
Who knew...

158
00:07:50,319 --> 00:07:50,800
Oh, well.

159
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,800
His Majesty can't perform in bed.

160
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:55,399
You...

161
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,839
Don't talk nonsense!

162
00:07:58,319 --> 00:07:59,759
How would you know that?

163
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,600
Why are you so worked up?

164
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,079
I...

165
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:06,199
I'm just defending him.

166
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,240
As far as I know,

167
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:09,079
His Majesty

168
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:11,879
is more than capable.

169
00:08:19,519 --> 00:08:20,759
How would you know

170
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:21,959
whether he can perform?

171
00:08:23,639 --> 00:08:24,319
I...

172
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,720
I just do.

173
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:29,839
Time for me to go.

174
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,679
What's your name?

175
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,000
Why?

176
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,000
Running a background check?

177
00:08:35,879 --> 00:08:36,559
Background check?

178
00:08:37,279 --> 00:08:38,879
(Right. This is ancient times.)

179
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:41,120
I'm done talking.

180
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,279
Maybe we'll meet again someday.

181
00:08:42,639 --> 00:08:43,120
Wait.

182
00:08:46,279 --> 00:08:48,200
She's definitely eccentric.

183
00:08:48,399 --> 00:08:49,639
And she talks utter nonsense.

184
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:52,519
Still, she's more interesting
than the dull people in this palace.

185
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,240
(Lixia Palace)
You scoundrel!

186
00:08:58,440 --> 00:09:01,279
You sneaked into a consort's chambers
to sleep with a maid?

187
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:02,720
(Ji Wujue, Emperor)
Spare me, Your Majesty!

188
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,840
It will never happen again!

189
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:04,840
Behead him.

190
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:05,799
Yes, Your Majesty.

191
00:09:06,159 --> 00:09:07,360
Mercy, Your Majesty!

192
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:08,759
Spare me!

193
00:09:08,879 --> 00:09:11,120
(Eunuch Cao, Chief Eunuch)
Where were you, Your Majesty?

194
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,440
I've been looking everywhere.

195
00:09:13,159 --> 00:09:16,559
Consort Yao and Consort Lan
were bickering, giving me a headache.

196
00:09:18,159 --> 00:09:19,360
I went for a walk.

197
00:09:19,759 --> 00:09:22,879
Will you still follow
the Empress Dowager's wishes

198
00:09:23,039 --> 00:09:24,200
and spend the night here?

199
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,879
Back to Shuxin Hall.

200
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:26,759
Yes, Your Majesty.

201
00:09:32,639 --> 00:09:33,440
One more thing.

202
00:09:34,879 --> 00:09:36,399
There was a maid in green

203
00:09:36,639 --> 00:09:38,399
in Lixia Palace today.

204
00:09:39,159 --> 00:09:40,480
Find her for me.

205
00:09:40,519 --> 00:09:41,320
Yes, Your Majesty.

206
00:09:42,279 --> 00:09:43,639
His Majesty is looking for

207
00:09:43,639 --> 00:09:45,240
a maid in green from Lixia Palace.

208
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,440
They say she offended him.

209
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,679
He's furious.

210
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,960
She's in for it when she's found.

211
00:09:55,399 --> 00:09:57,000
Dressed in green?

212
00:09:58,279 --> 00:09:59,159
Lixia Palace?

213
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:01,120
Could it be...

214
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,240
My lady!

215
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:03,879
My lady, we're in trouble!

216
00:10:03,919 --> 00:10:04,720
What is it?

217
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:07,240
They're searching for a maid in green.

218
00:10:07,279 --> 00:10:08,759
What maid in green?

219
00:10:08,759 --> 00:10:11,320
She offended His Majesty
at Lixia Palace a few days ago.

220
00:10:11,919 --> 00:10:13,480
I've thought it over.

221
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:16,000
It must be you, my lady.

222
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:19,679
(Did that ugly guy find out
I secretly painted him?)

223
00:10:21,279 --> 00:10:22,799
That pretty boy must have told on me.

224
00:10:22,799 --> 00:10:24,600
What's a pretty boy?

225
00:10:25,919 --> 00:10:26,919
Never mind that.

226
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:29,200
(I wonder what happens if you use)

227
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,480
(the Emperor's face without permission.)

228
00:10:30,799 --> 00:10:31,799
If anyone comes looking,

229
00:10:31,919 --> 00:10:32,720
tell them I'm ill.

230
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,000
I'm not seeing anyone.

231
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:35,159
My lady.

232
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,759
Your Majesty.

233
00:10:38,759 --> 00:10:40,799
The maids from Lixia Palace
you asked me to find

234
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:42,679
are all here.

235
00:10:49,679 --> 00:10:50,519
None of them.

236
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,200
Next group.

237
00:10:52,399 --> 00:10:53,200
Yes, Your Majesty.

238
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:54,279
Keep looking.

239
00:10:54,279 --> 00:10:55,080
Yes, Your Majesty.

240
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,680
(Consort Lan, Consort Yao)

241
00:11:08,919 --> 00:11:09,720
Your Majesty.

242
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:12,519
The Empress Dowager worries
you've neglected your consorts.

243
00:11:12,519 --> 00:11:14,080
She asks you to choose one tonight.

244
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:16,360
(Memorial)

245
00:11:18,279 --> 00:11:19,879
I have already done as she wished

246
00:11:19,879 --> 00:11:21,320
and taken two consorts.

247
00:11:21,519 --> 00:11:23,799
Must she decide when I bed them too?

248
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,759
There is no Empress,

249
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,679
and you rarely visit your consorts.

250
00:11:28,399 --> 00:11:30,600
She's worried about an heir.

251
00:11:32,559 --> 00:11:34,840
I only want children
with the woman I love.

252
00:11:35,799 --> 00:11:36,759
Besides,

253
00:11:36,759 --> 00:11:38,240
who says there is no empress?

254
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,960
Isn't there one in the Cold Palace?

255
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,720
The maid who brings her meals says

256
00:11:42,799 --> 00:11:44,960
she tried to end her life recently.

257
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:46,639
Now she's gravely ill

258
00:11:46,799 --> 00:11:48,120
and refusing to eat.

259
00:11:52,279 --> 00:11:54,879
Chancellor Lu sacrificed his clan
to save her.

260
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,399
Now she wants to die?

261
00:11:57,559 --> 00:11:59,639
She grew up sheltered.

262
00:11:59,879 --> 00:12:02,360
Losing her family must have
been too much for her.

263
00:12:03,559 --> 00:12:04,360
Forget it.

264
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:07,759
I promised Chancellor Lu
that I would keep her safe.

265
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:12,120
To the Cold Palace.

266
00:12:12,159 --> 00:12:12,919
Yes, Your Majesty.

267
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,840
(Cold Palace)
(His Majesty arrives!)

268
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,399
We're doomed!

269
00:12:20,519 --> 00:12:21,960
Why did he come here himself?

270
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:23,039
What do we do, my lady?

271
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,480
You can't refuse to see him.

272
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:25,480
Well...

273
00:12:26,559 --> 00:12:27,480
Tell him I'm ill.

274
00:12:27,519 --> 00:12:28,320
Dying, in fact.

275
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:29,200
It's contagious.

276
00:12:29,399 --> 00:12:31,120
But lying to the Emperor is a crime!

277
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:32,399
What if he finds out?

278
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,480
(His Majesty is here!)

279
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:36,000
(Come out and greet him!)

280
00:12:37,919 --> 00:12:38,799
Go and stall him.

281
00:12:38,799 --> 00:12:39,919
I have a plan.

282
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:48,040
(Cold Palace)

283
00:12:48,639 --> 00:12:49,919
Greetings, Your Majesty.

284
00:12:50,559 --> 00:12:51,360
How dare you!

285
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:53,000
Where is your lady?

286
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,960
My... my lady...

287
00:12:58,039 --> 00:12:58,919
She's ill.

288
00:12:58,919 --> 00:13:00,039
It's contagious.

289
00:13:00,399 --> 00:13:01,200
Well...

290
00:13:04,279 --> 00:13:05,000
Your Majesty.

291
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:18,000
Your Majesty.

292
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:20,799
I've caught a terrible disease.

293
00:13:21,679 --> 00:13:23,159
I don't want you to catch it.

294
00:13:26,120 --> 00:13:27,559
I am the Son of Heaven.

295
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:29,320
No poison can harm me.

296
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:57,280
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

297
00:13:57,720 --> 00:14:01,960
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

298
00:14:02,240 --> 00:14:06,280
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

299
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:10,720
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

300
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:14,920
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

301
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:19,320
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

302
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:23,120
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

303
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:28,280
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

304
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:32,080
♪No finery to rival spring♪

305
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:36,560
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

306
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:40,680
♪Where is beauty found?♪

307
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:45,400
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

308
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:47,440
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

309
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:49,600
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

310
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,040
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

311
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,040
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

312
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,920
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

313
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:58,600
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

314
00:14:59,080 --> 00:15:01,080
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

315
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:05,440
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
